{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕追着要回应会搅坏眼前的亲近，对方也没答应过他什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"追着要回应\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他把心思放回自己能做的事上，关心对方、替对方高兴，不必每次等到对方表示或保证，他也能从中得到快乐。\",\n      \"key\": \"表示或保证\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"这想法真让他松了口气，给得更痛快，不怕显得更在乎，也不计较给了多少，自己也觉得满足。\",\n      \"key\": \"给得更痛快\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想把喜欢给得更足，又怕眼前的亲近转眼就过去。想到太急会给对方压力，热情又收了回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"转眼就过去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他把这阵轻松当成了保证，以为只要不向对方要回应，就能尽情喜欢，也不会失去眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不会失去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去重复的“不想催”，不再重复前段已经说过的特别之愿。用S03-5解释他为何怕追问搅坏亲近，S03-3只说明他不能预设对方会回应；S02-3则说明他想保护的亲近为何如此重要。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把自我劝诫落到关心对方、替对方高兴这些具体事情上，同时明确保留不必每次得到对方表示或保证、自己也能从中快乐的心理事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\", \"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"压缩给得更多、不计较多少、不怕显得更在乎等重复意思，保留自我调整确实带来轻松和满足的变化。再写出他想把喜欢给得更足、又怕当下过去和给对方压力的拉扯，解释热情为何既打开又收回。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把暂时有效的办法误当成不会失去亲近的保证，明确这是他当时的相信，而非已经成立的事实，为下一段重新渴望回应、继而难堪留下直接前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f6da29b2-c65d-4491-bd19-e6dd639e3105", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T134041785063Z", "elapsed_seconds": 769.0, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T13:53:30.792309+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6a7ad1a93b6877addda006a5d22eb63a8da8bca2874bc2d16b56338838395036", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T134041785063Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"]